   "publish_time_utc": "2026-11-08 21:10:44",
   "text": "this is wild... a whole cozy fishing game built solo with Claude Opus 5.5 + Blender + 3D AI + Unity 6\n\nthe trick is giving every tool one job:\n\n→ generate every 3D model with Tripo Smart Mesh P2: palms, rocks, pier, boat, hut, character\n→ connect Claude Code to Blender through MCP\n→ let Opus 5.5 set up each model: scale, pivots, materials, clean export\n→ Opus animates in Blender too: the walk, the cast, the rod, the boat on the water\n→ bring it all into Unity 6 and build the world: forest, river, waterfall, beach, pier\n→ add one system at a time: walking, fishing, bait choice, time of day\n→ play after every step and fix one thing at a time\n\nwho does what:\n\n• Tripo: the 3D models\n• Opus 5.5 + Blender: setup and animation\n• Unity 6: the world and the game\n\none person. one stack. a game you'd actually want to play",
